      "end_minus_years": 0,
      "end_plus_years": 0,
      "note": "Start is the departure from Kristiania on 16 June 1903; end is the arrival at Nome on 30 August 1906. Linda Hall dates the emergence into the Beaufort Sea to 17 August 1905."
